          <line class="needle-h" x1="100" y1="92" x2="100" y2="46" stroke="var(--rosa-dk)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <circle cx="100" cy="92" r="5.5" fill="var(--rosa-dk)"/>
          <path d="M118 108 a14 14 0 1 1 -6 -11" fill="none" stroke="var(--rosa-dk)" stroke-width="1.6" opacity=".7"/><path d="M112 94 l0 4 4 -1" fill="none" stroke="var(--rosa-dk)" stroke-width="1.6" opacity=".7"/>
          <text x="100" y="132" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter" font-size="10.5" letter-spacing="1.6" fill="var(--ink-faint)">HEALTHY SKIN</text>
          <text x="100" y="152" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Cormorant Garamond" font-style="italic" font-size="15" fill="var(--rosa-dk)">rises, then returns</text>
        </g>
        <g transform="translate(200,0)">
          <path d="M40 92 A60 60 0 0 1 160 92" fill="none" stroke="var(--rosa-lt)" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <g stroke="var(--rosa)" stroke-width="1.5" opacity=".45"><line x1="40" y1="92" x2="49" y2="92"/><line x1="57.6" y1="49.6" x2="64.9" y2="55.2"/><line x1="100" y1="32" x2="100" y2="41"/><line x1="142.4" y1="49.6" x2="135.1" y2="55.2"/><line x1="160" y1="92" x2="151" y2="92"/></g>
          <line class="needle-b" x1="100" y1="92" x2="100" y2="46" stroke="var(--rosa)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <circle cx="100" cy="92" r="5.5" fill="var(--rosa)"/>
          <path d="M132 108 l0 -16 m-4 5 l4 -5 4 5" fill="none" stroke="var(--rosa)" stroke-width="1.6" opacity=".8"/>
          <text x="100" y="132" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter" font-size="10.5" letter-spacing="1.6" fill="var(--rosa-dk)">YOUR SKIN</text>
          <text x="100" y="152" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Cormorant Garamond" font-style="italic" font-size="15" fill="var(--rosa-dk)">only ever rises</text>
        </g>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <figcaption>the thermostat, and the ratchet</figcaption>
  </figure>

  <div class="compare rv">
    <div class="c healthy"><p class="eyebrow muted" style="margin-bottom:6px">Healthy skin</p><h4>A thermostat.</h4><p class="soft small" style="margin:0">It flushes. Then it clicks back down. Every time. The system resets itself.</p></div>
    <div class="c yours"><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px;color:var(--rosa-dk)">Your skin</p><h4 style="color:var(--rosa-dk)">A thermostat that only knows heat.</h4><p style="color:var(--rosa-dk);margin:0;font-size:14px">Every trigger turns it up. Nothing turns it down. So it just keeps climbing.</p></div>
  </div>

  <p class="rv">That's what no product I'd ever tried had done. Not because the ingredients were bad. Because each one was treating a single step — while the loop kept running through the other four.</p>
  <p class="rv">I stopped asking <em>"what calms redness?"</em> I started asking <em>"what interrupts the loop at all five points — simultaneously?"</em></p>
  <p class="rv" style="font-weight:500">Two years. One question.</p>

  <div class="pullquote rv">
    <p style="font-style:normal;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;color:var(--ink);font-weight:500">The Reset Complex™. That's what those five answers became.</p>
    <p style="font-style:normal;font-family:'Inter';font-size:16px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:400">Not a cream. Not a routine. A system built around one idea: <span style="color:var(--rosa);font-weight:500">your face isn't being calmed. It's being given back its ability to calm itself — and to tell the truth about you again.</span></p>
    <p style="font-style:normal;font-family:'Inter';font-size:16px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:400">The thermostat. The ability to come back down — and stay accurate.</p>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ========== 07 — PRODUCT INTRODUCTION ========== -->
<section class="brique wrap" id="product">
  <p class="rv">For two years I'd been trusting one symptom. For two years I tried to find what would deal with all five — simultaneously, at the right concentrations, without ingredients that would feed the loop.</p>

  <p class="serif center rosa-dk rv" style="font-size:clamp(26px,5vw,34px);font-weight:500;margin:15px 0 36px">Then I built it.</p>

  <div class="center rv" style="margin-bottom:18px">
    <h3 class="serif" style="color:var(--rosa-dk)">The Daily Reset Serum.</h3>
